---
description: Property Opportunity Map — multi-agent operating rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making changes. It defines the
multi-agent team (roles, contracts, handoff protocol, review gates).

Default role for Cursor sessions: **Data Engineer** or **Geospatial Feature
Engineer**, unless the human assigns something else.

Non-negotiables:

- Every feature record carries `known_as_of` (the date the information was
  publicly knowable). No look-ahead data.
- Canonical table schemas live in `docs/data-dictionary.md`; change them only
  via a dedicated PR.
- All configuration in `config/*.yml`; no hard-coded paths or thresholds.
- Never commit raw data (`data/raw`, `data/interim`, `data/processed`,
  `outputs/` are gitignored).
- Never fabricate metrics or source properties; write "unverified" instead.
- Branch as `agent/<role>/<slug>`; PRs only, never direct pushes to `main`.
